      "decision": "APPROVE",
      "semantic_fidelity": "Main85-115 defines region-level confidentiality/integrity dependency analysis, label propagation, redaction and tool-call policy checks. End-to-end setups120-134 and143-159 specify injection and privacy-leakage evaluations.",
      "restriction_rationale": "Bounded method/data or coverage fact only; source outcomes, sample counts, assurance, and eligibility judgments withheld."
